  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Right now, Go Home only exists in the Quick Menu, which needs a laser pointer and click, so it effectively takes two hands. The Action Menu (the same one used for Emoji and Stickers) can be operated one-handed with just a thumbstick flick, but Go Home is not available anywhere inside it, not even in Options.\n\nThis is a real problem for players who can only use one hand or one controller, whether due to disability or needing a fast way to leave an uncomfortable situation. Please add Go Home as an option inside the Action Menu's Options submenu so it can be triggered one-handed, the same way Emoji and Stickers already work.",
